# 24. Graceful Shutdown

When Kubernetes terminates a pod:

```text
SIGTERM
   ↓
Stop accepting new work
   ↓
Cancel workers
   ↓
Finish safe in-flight operation
   ↓
Commit/rollback
   ↓
Release resources
   ↓
Close MQ/Kafka
   ↓
Exit
```

Verify that shutdown cannot cause:

```text
Lost transaction
Duplicate transaction
Partial file
Uncommitted state
Corrupted output
```

