# 47. Final Acceptance Criteria

The application should be considered enterprise-ready only when:

```text
No unresolved P0 security issues
No unresolved P0 data-integrity issues
No known duplicate financial processing path
No known lost-message path
No uncontrolled parallelism
No uncontrolled memory growth
No blocking async operations
No unbounded retry loops
No critical secret exposure
Authorization enforced server-side
Graceful pod shutdown implemented
Pod restart recovery verified
Dependency failure recovery verified
Multi-DC behavior verified
Observability implemented
Correlation/traceability implemented
Critical business paths tested
Container security validated
React security validated
Accessibility baseline validated
```

Most importantly, do not only report problems.

For each actionable issue, provide the **specific remediation action and implementation approach**, and where code changes are allowed, make the remediation directly and validate it.

The final objective is:

**Secure + Correct + Resilient + Recoverable + Observable + Scalable + Maintainable enterprise application.**
